Theorem: theorem_2_46
Proof: llm_proof(strategy(Induction + simplification),steps([Apply induction on structure,Simplify using definitions,Use preservation lemmas,QED by reflexivity]),confidence(0.95),code(
theorem theorem_2_46 : ∀ (f : Feature), 
  rank f = 2^46 → is_identity f := by
  intro f h
  cases f
